{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever dreamed of crafting beautiful floral arrangements that brighten someone's day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flowers and Favours</strong> is a cozy and relaxing florist sim where you can craft beautiful bouquets, experiment with different blooms, and run your very own flower shop. This is your space to create and unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/dialor.gif?t=1742377820\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Listen and Learn</strong> - Chat with adorable customers to understand their unique stories and needs for the perfect bouquet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/tools.gif?t=1742377820\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash Your Creativity</strong> - Create one-of-a-kind bouquets using intuitive and flexible design tools\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/wrapping_process.gif?t=1742377820\" /><strong>Complete Your Masterpiece With the Perfect Wrap</strong> - Select from elegant wrapping options, ribbons, and finishing touches to make each bouquet truly special</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upcoming Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photo Mode </strong>- Capture your beautiful bouquets and keep them in a special memory book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop Customization </strong>- Decorate your flower shop and design a space that feels uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Workbench </strong>- Personalize your crafting area to match your floral style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special Events</strong> - Manage seasonal rushes with a calendar system for holidays and celebrations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Project Roadmap:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>March:</strong> Release of full trailer showcasing gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>April-May:</strong> Playable demo available for everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>August-September:</strong> Full game release \ud83c\udf89</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/wishlist_now.png?t=1742377820\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hello! I'm Iris - solo dev of this cozy game \ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udcbb <br>I\u2019m working hard to bring Flowers and Favors to life </strong>\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Support me by adding the game to your wishlist and following along on Steam!\u00a0</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3269600?t=1742377820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3269600?t=1742377820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/e8c9744da2c358dda8b813db0b936ed1cfc68dc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742377820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/e8c9744da2c358dda8b813db0b936ed1cfc68dc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742377820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever dreamed of crafting beautiful floral arrangements that brighten someone's day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flowers and Favours</strong> is a cozy